{"id": "unknown-2026-10-02-013", "date": "2026-10-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 40, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["ev_sales", "industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Kia emerges as Europe’s fastest-growing top 10 car brand after EV sales surge 58%", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/10/Kia-fastest-growing-Europe.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1400\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kia is crushing it in Europe with a full lineup of electric vehicles, ranging from entry-level models to the three-row flagship SUV. Thanks to its new EVs, <a href=\"https://electrek.co/guides/kia/\">Kia</a> is now Europe’s fastest-growing top 10 passenger car brand this year.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-page", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/10/02/kia-europes-fastest-growing-top-10-brand-ev-sales-surge-58/", "type": "rss"}]}
